  "brief": {
    "zh": "每次有效传输都代表接收机工作一次。重复编号也计入，坏读数不计入。审查第 2 天起仓储区每次传输，提交明细和位于正中间的温度。",
    "en": "Each valid transmission is one event for the receiver, even when an ID repeats. Discard bad readings. Audit storage transmissions from day 2 onward and deliver both their detail log and their median temperature."
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "重发计数、区域标准化与中位数",
    "en": "Retransmissions, normalized area names and median"
  },
